Visual reference: Raul Blanco, "Bouncing DVD Logo Screensaver 4K 60fps - 10 hours
NO LOOP", https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5mGuCdlCcNM. Measurements and a small
monochrome alpha mask were derived from the user-supplied reference. No video or
audio recording is bundled or published here. See docs/reference/provenance.json.

